Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:17.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小时候 我认为世界应该是更为单纯的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有赢不了的比试
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回报
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆为可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界单纯明晰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非胜即负 抑或是平局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:46.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更正确的一步棋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更优秀的战术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更高明的战略
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便对手是「最强」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:56.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也只思考着如何在下一步胜过对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无知且愚蠢的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:30.35,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.35,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无非就是骗孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:42.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是个无聊的游戏世界罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现实是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:50.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个世界只有混沌 不存在必然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充斥着偶然性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不讲理 不合常理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连存在的意义也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:10.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:18.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(971.4,884.7)\fad(500,0)}艾尔奇亚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么我赢不了的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我自负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打出生起 玩这种游戏只输过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「十条盟约」第六条
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举凡〈向盟约宣誓〉的打赌绝对要遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:07.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是唯一神所创造的「迪司博德」的绝对法则哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:12.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定会把你揍得落花流水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你连那两个人都赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是赢不了我的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:22.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空和白 你认识他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:27.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那接下来一边玩游戏 一边告诉你一些有趣的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为珍贵的点心的回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:33.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这样做 肯定是想让我在不知不觉中分心 的说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:36.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想说的话就随你说吧 的说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:42.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这原本可是没有对任何人诉说过的神话哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:51.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:55.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是发生在六千年以前的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:06.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开辟天地 杀死了星球的旷日持久的大战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有留在任何人的记忆或者记录里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:20.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但即便如此 却是唯有我不会忘却的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑灰的散布范围很广 抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}灵针盘怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:30.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为黑灰的缘故 已经变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能依靠五官来索敌了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心应对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快过来 这家伙真不得了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种制造的世界地图
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且这张还是最新版
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅有各种族的势力图 甚至还有地精种的战略地图
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺 亚雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:05.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和现有的地图进行比较和修正
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来解读战略地图
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向遗志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:27.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精族的通讯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:34.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}融合？ 爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:39.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们究竟要把这颗星球破坏成什么样子才肯罢休啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:45.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备跑路了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚雷 不要带走靠精灵运作的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想死就说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:32.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向遗志起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们家的孩子就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:51.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉啊 里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 妖魔种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:43.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前似乎曾经存在过被称为太阳的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白色的火团在空中散发着光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:50.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天空蔚蓝而又清澄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:54.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是古老的 宛如童话般的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:59.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸神与其被造物之间掀起的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:01.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}持续至永恒的斗争
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:04.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让大地化为焦土 灰烬遮蔽了天空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡的灰烬飞舞着落下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这灰烬…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:22.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能还算是一种慈悲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬 娜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是侬娜的名字吗 这个读作侬娜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:54.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}太狡猾了 也教教我嘛 克珑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:55.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明是我先的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按顺序来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:12.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你究竟要我们担心到什么地步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}话说 我不是一直让你叫我姐姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也已经算快的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:29.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:30.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:33.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:35.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:36.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:36.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}侬娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快看快看 这是我自己写的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}呐 爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个 侬娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:45.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:53.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的爸爸 不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:14.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:16.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:17.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:20.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为 爸爸和我约定好了要回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:24.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他明明说了最终胜利的会是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:29.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺为此竭尽全力去战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了让大家胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样根本不是胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:34.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:37.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不如让里克去死…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:37.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬娜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:56.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩快去洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:57.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要洗衣服就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.73,0:12:02.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们真是臭死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么为了胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个可恶的伪善者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可是让他舍弃了性命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他说了「去死」两个字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把话说明白 是你杀的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:34.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了让自己再活一会儿才让他牺牲的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:41.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坚持这种做法究竟有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟能持续到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:49.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到为了一千零一个人而杀死九百九十九个人的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要直到剩下最后一个人的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟什么时候才能结束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:02.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟什么时候才不用再受人欺凌 苟延残喘地活下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这样的世界诞生的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:16.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连没有理由地死亡也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同生存的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:26.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为「心」不承认这种毫无意义的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺的死不是毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:42.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏有海量情报的森精种的宫殿遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是能轻易发现的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能在这种世界保持着正常这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟能否被称作正常呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:14.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这个破坏的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是天翼种吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是巨大的建筑物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:10.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:14.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:36.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}检讨 整理状况中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:42.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:45.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些家伙一定是成群行动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以和她共享意识的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「连结体」肯定近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:53.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:58.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是在这里与她为敌 就会与整个机凯种族敌对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:08.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哥哥我忍不住了让我变成女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:09.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:17.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理解不能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解的是我 混账
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:28.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推测 符合场景的设定不够充分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:29.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不凑巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:34.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不是那种被你们观察了还能兴奋起来的变态
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:37.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疑问 「你们」是指谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别装傻 你们都是和连结体一起行动的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:45.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否定 本机已被「连结体」解除连接
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:47.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解除连接？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:49.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说你落单了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:50.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:53.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:59.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这只彷徨的机凯种找我这个人类有何贵干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以问问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:05.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答 解析人类的独有交流语言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是名为「心」的独有语言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:09.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「心」？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:10.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理由
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:14.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本机在调查关于「心」的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:16.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在对结果进行解析时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:19.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生大量逻辑错误 遭到废弃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:22.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那之后 便单独继续观测行动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:23.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}观测吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打算自己来解析「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后再连接回连结体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:30.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推测通过肌肤相亲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:37.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皮肤组织接触的独有语言为「心」的交流方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与本机进行生殖行为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:41.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:47.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代替方案 顺从欲望蹂躏本机也没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然没有「洞洞」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:52.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去死吧 话说居然没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:10.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏001 国际象棋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比赛 申请进行游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}条件 如果本机获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:22.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求将本机带回去 进行生殖行为
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:30.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏偏是国际象棋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机械的种族 和他们比演算的话毫无胜算吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:37.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:43.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:45.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:50.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允许将本机带回去 进行生殖行为
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.30,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪边都一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:55.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论选哪条路 都不会乖乖放我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按你说的做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结论 实行符合条件的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.31,0:19:03.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 比赛只有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是条件…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做一点小变动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:30.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:37.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 你这机动力 真的没有使用精灵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定 如果使用精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:43.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能缩短至五万五千七百八十二秒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:45.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}补充
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:48.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本机是解析体 通称Prüfer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}性能在机凯种全体的平均值之下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是这种荒唐的种族参加了战争
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怕是世界也要被毁掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:00.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要怎么称呼你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:01.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的是名字 你没有名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:10.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}个体识别号码 üc207号机Pr型4f57t9机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那能算是名字吗 不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再起一个更像人类的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:17.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提问 本机胜利所要求的条件是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:20.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在能够解析「心」之前留在里克的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有必要隐藏身为机械的事实吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过所谓的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:28.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从相互理解之中感受到的言外之意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要和我一起生活的话 只能扮成人类的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提问 名字可以自由设定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.35,0:20:35.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答 命名为休瓦尔扎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.80,ngnlzero - text - tips,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注：Schwarzer为德语“黑色”之意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太长了 而且也不像是名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:44.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以驳回
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:48.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不解 自由设定被订正了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能在进去之前把说话方式给改改吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}读取 模仿人格l610
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:59.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诶嘿嘿 哥哥 这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:00.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驳回
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:03.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反论 已经进行了极具逻辑性的设定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:06.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「其实我有个妹妹」什么的设定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是哪门子逻辑才说得通
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:12.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求 提供最符合状况的设定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:15.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掩饰你的过去太麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:19.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胆小而沉默寡言 不说多余的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:23.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加在句首的像机械一样的词也不许用 如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:27.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:35.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是演技吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:36.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演技？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:37.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:43.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同步了与提示设定一样的人物并加以模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:45.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:49.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要离开我的视线范围
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:50.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要脱掉衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:53.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个像尾巴一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:54.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能想些办法处理一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:57.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是休比的动力源
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:22:00.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}模拟精灵回路接续神经
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真没办法 就说是装饰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听好了 我再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:09.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不能让其他人看到你那机械的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:13.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 只给里克看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:17.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好可爱 这孩子咋这么可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:21.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回来时在毁灭的集落里发现的 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:23.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难不成…是新娘？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:24.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新娘？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:25.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}听人说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:26.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 别害羞嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.61,0:22:29.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个时代 一是生子二是食物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三四五都是生子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:32.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:33.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也别学
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这手势是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:36.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:38.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:39.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:42.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:44.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和里克是怎么认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:46.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:51.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克接吻… 然后强行要求了生殖行为
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:57.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:22:58.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:04.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种事… 等回来后再做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其他更好的说法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.97,0:23:10.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好说法？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:11.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.13,0:23:16.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}话说回来 你就不能变成再成熟一点的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:18.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要诱惑我的话就更得这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:22.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是里克喜欢的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:24.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有那种嗜好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:27.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你喜欢怎样的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说啊 你知道喜欢是什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想了解里克的「喜欢」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该说过心就是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有读懂言外之意才能理解的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:47.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 来玩游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:48.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.55,0:23:51.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时候是不得已才玩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏都是无意义的 我没时间能浪费在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.54,0:23:57.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是无意义的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:03.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是赢了休比的话 就出示里克你想要的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:04.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.45,0:24:09.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大战开始的理由 将其终结的要素之类
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:13.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:18.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}区区人类之躯 没兴趣也没必要知道这些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.37,0:24:21.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要说我想要什么的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:27.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸存的手段 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我带着你的真正目的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:38.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种所拥有的知识 数学 设计技术
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我赢了就把这些给我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.85,0:24:44.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:50.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在的行星环境
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.17,0:24:55.30,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类还幸存着 异常
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:25:00.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使根据机械种的分析 理由也尚不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:08.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生物角度上孱弱 文明不成熟 连运用精灵都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却依旧存活着
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是有理由的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:17.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着能存活下去的因素
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:23.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个因素 推测为「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:27.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想了解那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:27.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}我说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.66,0:25:31.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.24,0:25:32.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.07,0:25:37.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随意地开始战争 不断夺走我们的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还以为你会说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.44,0:25:42.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 人类你们为什么还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你们的「心」告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.21,0:25:49.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 让我来告诉你我的心情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:52.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只会夺取的机械全都一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们全都去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.86,0:26:00.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道因为你们死了多少人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:03.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多少人被杀了 多少人…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:06.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要让我杀死多少人…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.87,0:26:10.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让里克 哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:18.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 休比 说了很过分的话 如此推测
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.51,0:26:27.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掌握到里克的「心」想要杀了休比
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:34.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要刺这里 休比就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:38.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死？不是生物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:44.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永久停止 无法修复 「全损」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.99,0:26:48.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想要了解里克的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:53.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以如果里克的「心」想要这样做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.63,0:26:56.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就把休比杀死吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.97,0:27:06.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查顿 安东 艾尔玛 克伊 迪路 西里斯 艾德
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.68,0:27:11.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达勒尔 戴夫 拉克丝 维恩 埃里克 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.69,0:27:12.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:17.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆逊 辛塔 杨 扎扎 扎尔科 克莱因 哥洛
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:23.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皮塔 亚瑟 莫尔顿 奇米 达顿 赛洛 维治 沃利
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.59,0:27:28.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯 萨贝奇 里洛 波波 科顿 鲁特 西格尔 夏奥
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.22,0:27:33.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔夫 巴鲁特 亚索 凯文特 贝尔 阿哈德 汉特
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:36.57,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴鲁洛夫 玛莎希 梅梅甘 卡里姆
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:45.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总共四十八人 全部都是我命令他们去死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:49.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确由于大战死了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.96,0:27:52.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像拂去尘埃一般被杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:55.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 让他们去死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:58.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此宣告他们命运的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:01.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.27,0:28:37.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 醒着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:40.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉在你累的时候打扰了 能稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:44.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗷 告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:53.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么会骑在我身上 能解释下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:56.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克你说让我待在你视线范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.50,0:28:58.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指不要离开我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:28:59.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:02.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭上眼睛的话 能看到的范围就不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.63,0:29:03.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}在玩很有趣的play呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是play
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:07.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系姐姐我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.35,0:29:10.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束后叫我 我来给小休比洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:10.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:22.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克说 不能让他以外的人看见休比的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀已经调教好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.85,0:29:25.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑 求你了 住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:29.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就好说了 休比就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.78,0:29:31.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去把澡堂的人都打发走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:49.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.01,0:29:51.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么对不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:57.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加害者询问被害者的「心」 不合理
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:02.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与其说不合理 不如说是太神经大条了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:05.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比有神经传达回路
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.03,0:30:07.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:12.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 我也太感情用事了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:15.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是不能做的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:20.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使因为愤怒发狂打了你 也不能解决任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.63,0:30:22.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克想打休比
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.65,0:30:24.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是说说罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.30,0:30:27.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 也说不准
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.76,0:30:30.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.72,0:30:34.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 来玩游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.81,0:30:43.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别带着那种东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.23,0:30:48.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的笑 只在那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.53,0:30:50.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来玩游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:31:00.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想了解里克的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.17,0:31:04.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不想伤害里克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:08.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.43,0:31:12.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不想伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.01,0:31:14.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果想回连结体的话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:18.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起对我穷追不舍 还有其他能了解「心」的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:21.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 正确
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.48,0:31:25.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但休比不想伤害里克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.49,0:31:28.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.64,0:31:29.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你问我啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.66,0:31:33.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解答候补 列举
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.95,0:31:39.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连结体无所谓 无意义 没关系 拒绝同步 解析优先
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.12,0:31:41.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想了解里克的「心」 只要里克在就好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:45.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}error…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:47.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:55.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结论 好像 不想回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:56.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.27,0:32:03.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据不能特定 但是 好像是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:08.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是暧昧的说法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.07,0:32:11.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兵 前进到E4
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.83,0:32:13.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少让我先手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轮到里克了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.57,0:32:19.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我还在帮你洗头发 不公平吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.74,0:32:22.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 为啥这么长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.87,0:32:25.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}短发比较好的话 就剪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.57,0:32:26.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用剪啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:30.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是让人难以捉摸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.58,0:33:07.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:12.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小型望远镜设计成功
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.09,0:33:14.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:16.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没赢过你象棋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:19.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得里克你会想要这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.98,0:33:25.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克遇见的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.02,0:33:30.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 虽然在意那里不自然的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是太远了 人类是无法频繁出入那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:39.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到达
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:46.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还真是便利的机器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.58,0:33:51.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现了吗 虽然周围的建筑物全被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.63,0:33:54.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这片地面却不知为何没有受到损害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.30,0:33:58.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精种的防御魔法的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:02.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他地方都是损毁状态 为什么只有这里完好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.10,0:34:09.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对森精种很重要的避难设施 保护设施
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:13.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者 有着在此之上的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.49,0:34:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新兵器的研究 开发设施
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:30.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.13,0:34:34.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神灵种凯那斯的 加护刻印
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:37.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯那斯 森精种的创造者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.09,0:34:40.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是加护刻印
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.80,0:34:45.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和数据库里森精种使用的刻印 术式完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.27,0:34:49.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又制造了些什么新的胡来的东西了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:53.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精种那群东西 净会热衷于破坏星球的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.32,0:34:59.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚空第零加护·理论验证试验炉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.41,0:35:02.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克能看懂森精语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.91,0:35:07.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辛苦拿到手的情报却读不懂的话就没有价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.66,0:35:12.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过口传或笔记等一切能想到的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:16.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将其他种族的性质 语言 甚至是习惯连绵不断传至今日
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.80,0:35:22.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类也不只是一味地被杀而已
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:27.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然这么说 除此之外就完全看不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.56,0:35:31.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是这里 是名字吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:34.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是森精种的机密情报的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.82,0:35:38.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被暗号化的可能性很高
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.28,0:35:39.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:44.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题在于连相关人员的名字都得用暗号写这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.83,0:35:47.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚空第零加护
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.66,0:35:52.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定不是什么好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.05,0:35:58.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 后退
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.57,0:36:01.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开 通行规制」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.52,0:36:08.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.27,0:36:15.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:19.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.71,0:36:26.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.37,0:36:28.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.77,0:36:50.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.77,0:36:52.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.73,0:36:59.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.19,0:37:06.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全系统 森精种的术式还运转着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:09.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.08,0:37:12.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开 伪典 森空嗫」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:22.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.92,0:37:29.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种的特性 能将受到的攻击解析 模仿 再现 复制
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.43,0:37:33.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然身为解析体Prüfer的休比
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.39,0:37:36.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能再现攻击的一成不到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:41.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算这样你也够胡来的了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.99,0:37:46.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.74,0:37:51.99,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比打破了约定 使用了精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:55.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起死在那里好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.92,0:38:00.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在被怪物们探知之前 赶紧撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.30,0:38:08.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶 黑灰暴风雨吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:10.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:14.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有能够去除黑灰污染的除染液
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:16.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没问题但我有
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.53,0:38:27.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你带国际象棋过来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.45,0:38:28.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.95,0:38:32.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没在怪你啦 来玩游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.79,0:38:34.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:39.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亏得这场暴风雨 我们也不会被其他种族探知到
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.71,0:38:41.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好拿来打发时间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.84,0:38:51.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶 又输了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.89,0:38:52.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来一回
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.39,0:38:57.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克为什么明明赢不了还要继续比试呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.27,0:38:58.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赢不了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.94,0:39:02.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克一次都没有赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.44,0:39:06.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才逼得你思考了很久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.90,0:39:09.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁说绝对赢不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.45,0:39:16.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 有点明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:22.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在的行星环境 对人类来说是致命的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.92,0:39:25.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够存活下来 异常
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:29.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种异常 订正 伟业
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.22,0:39:32.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将其变为可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:35.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是里克的「心」 意志
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.73,0:39:43.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此 人类 能存活下来 是客观事实
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.86,0:39:48.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是里克你 却并不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.57,0:39:52.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想认同自己 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.20,0:40:01.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我问你 在这种世界苟延残喘下去有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:07.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不断地逃跑延命 在这之后又能怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.21,0:40:09.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底要怎么做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:12.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要闭嘴像灰尘一样消散就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.43,0:40:14.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不愿意这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.20,0:40:17.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了一千零一个人而对九百九十九个人见死不救
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:19.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样世界就会改变吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:21.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:28.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我啊休比 到底要怎么做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.23,0:40:33.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到底要怎么做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:39.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道这个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:43.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的「心」是怎么回答的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.30,0:40:49.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你面前露出这么不像话的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是不知道才问你的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.63,0:40:55.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不带这样的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.55,0:40:58.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克想怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.64,0:41:02.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.73,0:41:08.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管答案是什么 休比都会帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.23,0:41:11.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到了解里克的「心」为止
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.74,0:41:13.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比都会陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.11,0:41:18.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你身边见证 你的「心」想怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.54,0:41:20.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:24.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想做里克想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.63,0:41:36.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将死
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.47,0:41:42.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.47,0:41:44.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少应该是平手的场景才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.77,0:41:45.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就气氛上来说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.77,0:41:45.73,ngnlzero - text - tips2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(897.6,979.2)}空气
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.81,0:41:49.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大气状况怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.69,0:41:55.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:06.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好美
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.71,0:42:14.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 不孑然一身 也不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:19.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克一直都不是孤身一人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.14,0:42:24.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我一直都像个笨蛋一样在逞强装帅罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:25.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.56,0:42:32.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是单纯的遵从自己的愿望行动也挺不错
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.03,0:42:44.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 告诉我这场大战的目的和结束条件
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.12,0:42:52.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小时候 我认为世界应该是更为单纯的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有赢不了的比试
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回报
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:42:59.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆为可能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.63,0:43:03.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界单纯明晰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.22,0:43:07.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非胜即负 抑或是平局
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.02,0:43:11.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用天真无邪的目光看着这个世界的孩子曾想过
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:17.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是无知且愚蠢的孩子曾想过的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.99,0:43:20.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.84,0:43:25.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.54,0:43:32.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比在一起的话 感觉在这个世界也能做些有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.48,0:43:37.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 就是那个 休比觉得那个眼神好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.17,0:43:39.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼神好？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.90,0:43:41.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.72,0:43:49.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比喜欢那个眼神 应该是？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.48,0:43:56.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还真是暧昧的说法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.89,0:44:27.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.73,0:44:32.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷静点 往西边出口跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.27,0:44:33.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬娜 跟大家一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:35.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.73,0:44:41.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.07,0:44:46.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.95,0:44:52.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶 这里也要灰飞烟灭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.45,0:44:58.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今为止 至今为止我到底是为了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.26,0:45:02.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.72,0:45:06.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以后就由姐姐来接手
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.35,0:45:10.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 证词录好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.75,0:45:12.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.48,0:45:15.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以克珑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.31,0:45:18.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从今天开始 集落的长老就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:21.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是新集落的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:23.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从西边的避难路线走很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.70,0:45:25.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么之后就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.61,0:45:29.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等啊里克 没有你在的话我和集落都会…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:31.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 克珑在的话就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.08,0:45:36.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为从今往后我不会再让任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.88,0:45:39.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.26,0:45:53.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呐 你们俩打算开始干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:55.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏而已
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.02,0:46:00.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是要开始孩童的玩乐罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.31,0:46:03.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里的各位 全都没来得及避难
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.09,0:46:06.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和集落一起殒命了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:11.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是已不存在于世界上的「幽灵」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.40,0:46:15.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总有一天会迎来停战
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.81,0:46:18.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经不想等待这种不会到来的未来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.50,0:46:23.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种混账世界里苟延残喘
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:24.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后只是祈祷战争结束吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.46,0:46:29.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向谁祈祷？向那些自称神的破坏者们吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.07,0:46:32.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天翼种的创造者阿尔特休
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.73,0:46:35.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精种的创造者凯那斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.41,0:46:38.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种的创造者欧肯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.60,0:46:42.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那群家伙为了证明自己才是这世界的唯一神
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:46.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不断争斗着 围绕着唯一神的宝座连带世界也一起破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.08,0:46:49.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到底要向这些混账东西祈求些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.76,0:46:56.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多该承认了吧 在这个世界根本不存在希望
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.26,0:47:01.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 只能用我们的手来创造
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:05.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个世界果然还是单纯的「游戏」
Comment: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:03.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,——50:00——
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.30,0:47:09.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些破坏者们只是为了占有「星杯」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.89,0:47:14.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥有这个世界绝对支配权的「概念装置」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.47,0:47:17.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而沉迷于没有规则的无聊的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.52,0:47:22.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我们就创造出我们想要的规则就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.61,0:47:24.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.90,0:47:29.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第一】不能杀死任何人」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:32.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为内心不想杀死任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:35.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第二】不允许让任何人死去」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.41,0:47:37.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为内心不想有任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:40.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第三】不能被任何人看穿」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.70,0:47:42.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为被看穿就意味着死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.48,0:47:45.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第四】任何手段都是正当的」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.78,0:47:47.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为只要不被看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.20,0:47:49.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何作弊就不能叫做作弊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:52.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第五】他们的规则和我们没有任何关系」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.89,0:47:55.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为内心不认同互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.18,0:47:59.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第六】违反以上规则的情况一律视为败北」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.22,0:48:04.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为内心觉得违反这些规则的胜利 没有价值可言
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.11,0:48:08.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以上 就是「想要的规则」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.86,0:48:11.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.76,0:48:14.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括神灵种在内的全种族
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.76,0:48:16.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不能杀死任何一人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.61,0:48:18.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也绝不能被任何人看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.29,0:48:22.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要做的只有引导战局 终结这场战争
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.58,0:48:27.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大战的终结 那就是我们的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:31.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌人是神 拥有毁天灭地的暴力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.39,0:48:32.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人绝望的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.68,0:48:34.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胜算如尘埃般微小
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:38.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为达成胜利条件的前提为在暗中行动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.52,0:48:41.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以就算获胜也不会留在任何人的记忆和记录中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.94,0:48:44.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们是幽灵 而幽灵并不会诉说
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.65,0:48:49.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 如果
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.15,0:48:55.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能完成这个游戏 获胜的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.41,0:48:59.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就可以想着我们曾经最棒最帅气地活过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.00,0:49:02.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后昂首挺胸地死去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.54,0:49:10.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 想开始那种游戏的人就留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.22,0:49:19.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就直说了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.64,0:49:23.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为你们会更聪明一些的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:27.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 第一步就预料错了这还是饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.51,0:49:31.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克你啊 觉得这个世界上还有聪明人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.46,0:49:33.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比这个世界更加疯狂的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.24,0:49:34.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事到如今还能找得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.32,0:49:37.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贤者在这个世界会选择死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.45,0:49:40.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而更聪明的贤者则会选择不出生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.08,0:49:44.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里的人 都是选择相信里克你的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:49.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不就像是愚者代表选拔么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.88,0:49:54.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人是愚蠢的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.42,0:49:55.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因为愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.97,0:49:57.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了不被那份愚蠢所杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.97,0:49:59.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才会磨炼自己的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:01.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个没有生存价值的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依然活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.89,0:50:08.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了活下来而赌上所有才智 智慧 技术的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.15,0:50:10.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若不是自命不凡的愚者
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.07,0:50:13.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值得尊敬的弱者又会是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.90,0:50:19.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来大干一场吧 向我们同胞的遗志起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.28,0:50:21.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向遗志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.99,0:50:27.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们是以赞同的规则起誓而行动的而不是亡者的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.16,0:50:29.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:32.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向同样的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:39.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 来开始游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.61,0:50:50.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 休比果然不理解「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.40,0:50:56.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作战的成功率 不管哪个环节都不够百分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.65,0:50:59.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是大家都觉得肯定会成功吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.45,0:51:02.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我问你 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.89,0:51:04.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投骰子投出六的概率是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.65,0:51:07.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.21,0:51:10.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么如果有并不存在的谁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:13.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把骰子换成只能投出六的骰子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.63,0:51:17.22,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(806.4,974.4)}战况
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.63,0:51:17.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对变数进行人为操作
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.30,0:51:18.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:21.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是作弊 很有趣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.26,0:51:24.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就是计算中的特异点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.14,0:51:30.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引导所有的设想 战略 计算往我们所期待的方向发展
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.98,0:51:32.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:33.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.32,0:51:38.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了的话 概率论就只是牵强附会而已
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.58,0:51:44.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 所有都会被动摇 概率论里也没有零与一百
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.20,0:51:47.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是纸上谈兵罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.83,0:51:49.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我证明给你看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.00,0:51:54.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提问 我现在在这里向休比告白的概率是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.96,0:51:59.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不清楚问题的意图 粗算大概为零
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.72,0:52:01.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看吧 算错了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.85,0:52:09.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请和我结婚吧 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.94,0:52:19.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.65,0:52:20.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.95,0:52:24.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常抱歉 明明是个处男真是十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.95,0:52:26.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.37,0:52:31.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类在繁殖的时候所缔结的契约
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.37,0:52:34.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比是机凯种
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.00,0:52:35.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种事情我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.54,0:52:39.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是想一直和休比在一起而已
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.67,0:52:42.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何 现在我就在你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.80,0:52:44.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是这个意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.05,0:52:45.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是想你作为我人生的伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.10,0:52:49.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种不能繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.26,0:52:50.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.43,0:52:52.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能进行繁殖行为
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:54.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克就一生都是处男
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:52:57.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.15,0:52:58.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犹豫了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.07,0:53:00.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要在意这些细节
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.28,0:53:03.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.45,0:53:05.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.87,0:53:07.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.28,0:53:10.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为里克的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.62,0:53:14.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转告
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.58,0:53:16.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由「解析体」到「全连结指挥体」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.21,0:53:16.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}裁决
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.17,0:53:19.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把里克故乡毁灭的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.38,0:53:24.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}典开 Org.2807「通行规则」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.65,0:53:38.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是休比
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:51.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使如此 里克也能说出同样的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.75,0:53:55.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 其实我早就注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.29,0:53:57.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也只是隐隐约约而已
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.34,0:54:01.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.63,0:54:08.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最初觉得有违和的是 第一次我们见面的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.22,0:54:12.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么选择的游戏是国际象棋这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.43,0:54:19.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且又为什么会在离村落那么远的地方埋伏呢之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.02,0:54:22.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还真是意外地不小心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.65,0:54:24.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明明知道 但又为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.90,0:54:31.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可能是在明知这一切的情况下还是喜欢上了休比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.54,0:54:35.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比毁灭了我的故乡这一过去并不能改变
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.29,0:54:40.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要是否定了这一点的话 我们就不会相遇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.17,0:54:44.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果就是结果 扭曲也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.63,0:54:48.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咬牙切齿地懊悔 哭喊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.59,0:54:51.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次 下次会向前迈进
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.51,0:54:55.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以休比才会对我感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.35,0:54:57.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.98,0:55:02.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对休比的过去 在我旁边的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.82,0:55:04.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及从现在开始想与你在一起的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.44,0:55:07.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都深爱着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.32,0:55:11.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我们两个在一起 就算是这种世界我也想活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.62,0:55:16.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我们两个在一起 我就能一直笑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.08,0:55:21.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以能无视一切道理
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.34,0:55:24.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我携手同行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.84,0:55:27.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为我的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:34.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.48,0:55:41.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}字面上的意思 正如你所看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.48,0:55:45.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小女不才
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.53,0:55:54.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但请让我一直留在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.62,0:55:59.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.17,0:56:07.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丈夫里克 请问你是否愿意娶休比为妻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.26,0:56:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并发誓与她携手同行 支持她 爱她 与她一起活下来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.30,0:56:13.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.47,0:56:16.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的里克 这里应该用「向遗志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.43,0:56:18.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 那个已经取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.52,0:56:20.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以应该用向「向同样的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.56,0:56:25.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我不知道的地方干了各种各样的事情还真是让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.23,0:56:26.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}话说你这是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.56,0:56:28.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑到不知道哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.14,0:56:31.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一但跳出来 什么前兆都没有就突然说要结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.96,0:56:34.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说要举行仪式的是克珑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.50,0:56:35.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}话说悄悄话也太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:39.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妻子休比 愿意以里克为丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.91,0:56:42.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发誓与他携手同行 支持他 爱他
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.12,0:56:42.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.46,0:56:49.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向给予了休比的存在与出生意义以及心的里克发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.59,0:56:51.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不会让里克死去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:54.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他活下来直到最后也与他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.80,0:56:55.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向同样的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:04.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之作为姐姐 恭喜弟弟结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.78,0:57:05.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别 克珑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.37,0:57:15.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.17,0:57:16.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.95,0:57:20.54,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这是里克所选的新娘 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.45,0:57:24.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 最后把名字刻在这个上面
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.58,0:57:26.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刻在这个石头上？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.09,0:57:31.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟你们在明面上是不存在的 所以是不会被记载的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.71,0:57:32.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.17,0:57:34.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 我的姓氏
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.80,0:57:37.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以后就是我们三人的姓氏了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.06,0:57:43.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的姓氏还真拗口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.39,0:57:47.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.36,0:57:52.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两人 大家要做什么我并不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.69,0:57:55.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两人已经不存在于这个世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:59.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.95,0:58:02.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有很重要的弟弟和可爱的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.29,0:58:05.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.29,0:58:08.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经不想失去家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.63,0:58:11.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要太乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.80,0:58:14.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不有任何人死也不会让任何人死
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.97,0:58:17.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有这个游戏我绝对会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.05,0:58:20.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交给我们吧 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.36,0:58:35.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这气味 是灵骸
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.99,0:58:38.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愧是兽人种
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.28,0:58:43.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃了我也无所谓 但是味道我可不敢保证
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.83,0:58:45.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.37,0:58:50.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们作为据点的露西亚大陆西侧的海湾
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.92,0:58:53.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种在进行起爆实验
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.67,0:58:56.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是连神灵种都能杀死的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.72,0:58:59.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被称为「髓爆」的大规模破坏兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.47,0:59:03.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是血坏个体对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:07.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该能想办法潜入地精种的设施
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.02,0:59:11.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随便你们怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.61,0:59:16.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种的舰队 警戒着兽人种进行移动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.70,0:59:21.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兽人种害怕「髓爆」而开始离开露西亚大陆
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.53,0:59:26.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着将森精种的机密情报透露给地精种
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:27.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.37,0:59:31.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后工作就是这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.63,0:59:36.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.54,0:59:41.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样吧 请让我以幽灵自称
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.18,0:59:46.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然擅自闯进来 肯定会有相应的紧要事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.77,0:59:50.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和你玩个简单的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.69,0:59:51.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.85,0:59:54.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双方的筹码是情报
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.11,0:59:56.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赢了你就提供给我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,0:59:58.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}输了就反过来提供给你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.82,1:00:01.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道从哪里来的谁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.95,1:00:05.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然觉得能和我妮娜·克莱布比试？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.62,1:00:07.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么先给你一个情报吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.95,1:00:10.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种已经知道了「虚空第零加护」的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.33,1:00:12.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之类的如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.58,1:00:16.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为「虚空第零加护」理论倡导者的你的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.00,1:00:23.05,ngnlzero - hm,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.4,864)}妮娜·克莱布
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.88,1:00:20.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全可以用自己的方法来验证这个情报的真伪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.01,1:00:22.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.26,1:00:28.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 不管你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:30.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来不能放着你不管呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.64,1:00:34.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我这边的筹码是「虚空第零加护」理论倡导者…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.95,1:00:38.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是你 这一情报我已经掌握了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.28,1:00:42.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后上述所说的是谎言的情报
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.32,1:00:47.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你想用魔法让我相信这一谎言的情报
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.16,1:00:54.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我这边的筹码
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.92,1:00:57.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在得知「虚空第零加护」存在的前提下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.92,1:01:02.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种仍然将其判断为不成问题的根据
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.30,1:01:04.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.80,1:01:07.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那个难道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.14,1:01:09.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我掌握了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.14,1:01:15.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种拥有与「虚空第零加护」相比同等或更强兵器的情报
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.61,1:01:22.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「髓爆」？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.07,1:01:28.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 能把大陆整个消灭的大规模破坏兵器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.54,1:01:33.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然能造出超越赌上森精种全部灵力的最强灵坏术式
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.37,1:01:37.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虚空第零加护」的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.79,1:01:39.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.84,1:01:43.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有时候是故意输给我的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.01,1:01:46.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请让我最后问一次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.22,1:01:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是敌还是友
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.39,1:02:00.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非敌非友 只是想让你们尽量不出现死者
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.44,1:02:03.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 幽灵先生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:07.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说得到这些情报之后要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.78,1:02:09.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都随我便对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.33,1:02:19.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺带一提 妮娜·克莱布是我的假名
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.71,1:02:24.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的真名是辛克·尼尔巴连
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.88,1:02:27.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的演技你有看穿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.43,1:02:33.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有叫过你一次妮娜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.98,1:02:43.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然将我玩弄于手掌之上这件事我会让你后悔的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.98,1:02:47.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传出森精种很粘人这种传闻的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.07,1:02:51.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是别人 正是尼尔巴连家
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.29,1:02:58.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 里克快把除染液喝下去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.25,1:03:03.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 你骗我 你明明说了只用一个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.63,1:03:06.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把这么多黑灰涂在身上两个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.85,1:03:17.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没办法啊 不这样做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.89,1:03:20.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一瞬间就会暴露
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.81,1:03:25.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就算她这么聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.57,1:03:28.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也想不到我会进行这种自杀行为吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.16,1:03:32.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.36,1:03:37.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边好像也快不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.79,1:03:43.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接下来大概可以活多久
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.33,1:03:46.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会让你死的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.01,1:03:50.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克要在休比死之前活着
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:54.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种的寿命有多长
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.89,1:03:58.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耐用年数还有八百九十二年
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.34,1:04:03.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那还真是得加把劲呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.73,1:04:08.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样一来 第一目标
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:13.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把战线排除出人类的生存圈 达成
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.24,1:04:20.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精种之后是森精种 连兽人种都陆续离去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.83,1:04:22.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.88,1:04:26.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莉莉 拜托你看守一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.84,1:04:28.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 克珑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.18,1:04:33.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幽灵的暗中活动之后也在继续
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.97,1:04:38.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和计划一样 森精种和妖精种结盟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.64,1:04:43.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}增加了和地精种的航空舰队抗衡的龙精种的契约数
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.90,1:04:48.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面 地精种和关系良好的巨人种
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.73,1:04:51.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及多数的幻想种结盟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.07,1:04:54.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被幽灵的情报所恫吓
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.45,1:04:58.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个阵容互相警戒对方所持有的大规模破坏兵器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.62,1:05:01.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将据点移至了邻近的阿利耶拉大陆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.25,1:05:07.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是那边还有不可忽视的最大威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.13,1:05:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥有天翼种的神灵种 阿尔特休阵营
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.14,1:05:17.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行规则」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.02,1:05:24.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二十三项设置完成 还剩九项
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.02,1:05:29.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在加上其他准备坐收渔翁之利的种族
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.47,1:05:33.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界正处于一触即发的最终决战的倒计时了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.13,1:05:37.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部都和设想一致
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.47,1:05:44.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说休比 游戏之神存在吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.01,1:05:50.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说我见过他 你会相信吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.04,1:05:55.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙总是会下超越我预料的棋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.95,1:05:58.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每次都输给了他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.67,1:06:02.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是那真是非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.46,1:06:08.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次 下次肯定能赢 总是这样想着
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.98,1:06:13.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我一定要和他在游戏中做了断
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.78,1:06:17.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那个时候的游戏还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.08,1:06:23.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克相信的话 休比也相信
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.33,1:06:30.54,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克说有就有 不会怀疑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.00,1:06:39.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶 刚刚那句话真想向别人炫耀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.89,1:06:40.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.93,1:06:43.47,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.01,1:06:46.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.44,1:06:54.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克说的一样 没有出现战死者
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.28,1:06:57.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没有其他种族的目击情报
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.11,1:06:58.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.91,1:07:02.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这是里克你们做的事情的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.49,1:07:05.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.45,1:07:09.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是里克 你清楚你身体现在的情况吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.71,1:07:10.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:11.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题大着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.09,1:07:13.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身体这么破烂不堪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.55,1:07:16.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.17,1:07:18.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.30,1:07:23.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多是指什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.26,1:07:26.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么时候才能不让我担心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.36,1:07:33.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.44,1:07:37.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道诸神为什么在互相争斗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.95,1:07:40.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一神的宝座
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.91,1:07:42.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 正如休比所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.12,1:07:45.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}具体来说好像是指「星杯」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.54,1:07:48.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是神灵种们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.58,1:07:54.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了将真正的神限定为一个人而设定的「概念装置」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.46,1:07:55.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「概念装置」？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:07:59.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种东西到底在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.38,1:08:02.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」的出现条件
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.22,1:08:07.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」会出现在这个星球最强大的力量面前
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.31,1:08:14.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此 有十位神灵 杀掉其余九人自己就是唯一神
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.65,1:08:17.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们就是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.28,1:08:22.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傻不傻啊 竟然因为这种理由把我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.78,1:08:25.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克珑 说傻实在是太失礼了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.49,1:08:29.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为就算不这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.33,1:08:32.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」也会出现啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.21,1:08:36.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我才聚集那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.30,1:08:42.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虚空第零加护」「髓爆」「天击」
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.93,1:08:47.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此强大的力量集中在这一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.51,1:08:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将这颗星球贯穿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星球？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.35,1:08:57.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的神灵种 都是从这颗星球的精灵回路诞生的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.32,1:09:01.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说这世上最强的力量就是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.36,1:09:03.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精灵回路
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.20,1:09:07.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由最弱的我们所布置的最后的舞台
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:09.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}借用那些家伙的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.59,1:09:13.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将这个世界的力量平衡从根基开始一口气打破
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.45,1:09:16.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」就会出现
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.59,1:09:19.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到「星杯」的同时成为唯一神
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.53,1:09:21.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将星球再构成
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:23.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关键的总攻击的诱导
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.20,1:09:29.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由能歪曲力量指向性的休比的兵装来实行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.22,1:09:33.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}设置「通行规则」三十二项
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.52,1:09:37.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理论上可以收集破坏这颗星球的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.90,1:09:41.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还剩下九项 只要设置完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.28,1:09:43.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将死
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.28,1:09:47.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们用自身的力量将星球贯穿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.03,1:09:50.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而「星杯」则由我收下从而获胜
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因为没有任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.04,1:09:57.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束之后还真想听听神明大人们会说些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.96,1:10:02.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们现在是什么心情呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.01,1:10:03.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.30,1:10:05.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.81,1:10:13.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.40,1:10:21.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你向大家说了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.74,1:10:25.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.57,1:10:28.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}村落肯定都发生大骚乱了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.91,1:10:32.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别出来太久啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.33,1:10:38.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么啊 你出去的时候我可是一直都…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.04,1:10:43.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侬娜和大家都拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.14,1:10:59.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.52,1:11:02.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 不快点去设置「通行规则」的话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.32,1:11:07.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系的 不会立刻发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.36,1:11:09.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的预料是不会错的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.91,1:11:10.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.20,1:11:13.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微休息一下没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.54,1:11:17.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的话休息一天就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.42,1:11:27.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是啊 那我今天就专心地休养一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.97,1:11:34.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 拖你后腿真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.85,1:11:39.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 你现在快睡觉 没有拖后腿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:45.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么休比 这是我的请求
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.78,1:11:50.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡觉的时候能握着你的手吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.62,1:11:57.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会一直握着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.62,1:12:01.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放心吧 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.13,1:12:10.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 我能遇见你真是非常感激
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.47,1:12:18.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的爱你 从今以后也是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.32,1:12:37.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.37,1:12:42.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.00,1:12:47.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精灵同盟的虚空第零加护
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.30,1:12:49.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}矮人同盟的髓爆
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.55,1:12:53.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是哪一方都是杂鱼 居然想挑战主人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.19,1:12:54.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是愚蠢至极
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.21,1:12:57.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好疼
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.81,1:12:59.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愚蠢的是你 阿兹莉尔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.90,1:13:02.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此我们也不能轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.10,1:13:07.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然阿尔特休大人要等待时机 那我们也只好静候了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.86,1:13:11.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是无聊呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.87,1:13:20.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有八项
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.91,1:13:25.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要拿到星杯的话 里克就不会死了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:28.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 等着我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.88,1:13:29.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.38,1:13:35.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天一个人在散步吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.68,1:13:41.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现了微量的精灵反应 就调查了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.60,1:13:44.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到竟然有意外的收获呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.44,1:13:50.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贵安 废铁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:13:59.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警告
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.29,1:14:04.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果与本机敌对 将实施相应的措施
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.96,1:14:08.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就凭你一只「解析体」吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.59,1:14:14.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经确认半径100km以内没有其他机凯种反应
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.42,1:14:19.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此这可是收获稀有度极高的头颅的好时机呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.81,1:14:22.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 不能杀死任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.14,1:14:26.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸好对于机凯种来说没有死的概念
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.23,1:14:29.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二 不允许让任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.15,1:14:32.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请不要进行无谓的抵抗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.36,1:14:32.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.69,1:14:33.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:36.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本机为废弃机体 没有价值
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.86,1:14:40.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六 违反以上规则的情况一律视为败北
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.58,1:14:42.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.91,1:14:45.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你…放我一马
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.08,1:14:51.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机凯种居然会说出求饶的话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.05,1:14:55.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而而而且还是解除连结的缺陷品？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.42,1:14:59.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是稀有中的稀有喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.98,1:15:04.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌我战力分析
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.68,1:15:07.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胜率——全无
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.73,1:15:09.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.23,1:15:13.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}概率论里不存在「0」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.86,1:15:22.47,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「读取」 代码1673B743E1F255脚本E 启动
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.08,1:15:23.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.41,1:15:28.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最终展开
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.42,1:15:33.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赌上全武装、战力、战术
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.59,1:15:36.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始求饶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.84,1:15:44.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀 机凯种是解析并模仿击破要素的种族吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.06,1:15:49.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道有哪位是被笑着杀死的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.81,1:15:51.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「制速违反」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.49,1:16:06.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「全方交叉」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.96,1:16:19.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处散布灵骸 真是对环境不友好的机械呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.18,1:16:23.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是就凭这样子就想把我怎么样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.64,1:16:26.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然想都没想过
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.64,1:16:31.83,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开」——「伪典·焉龙啸」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.28,1:16:44.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一方通行」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.20,1:16:48.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样跳跃到天翼种无法探知的范围
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.62,1:16:50.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.88,1:16:51.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.54,1:16:54.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去哪儿~
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.39,1:17:10.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 本来瞄准的是颈部来着
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.02,1:17:13.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失手了么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.27,1:17:20.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到机械居然会有第六感呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.65,1:17:22.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有种不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.82,1:17:24.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要留下头就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.20,1:17:29.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候让你像废铁一样埋在土里了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.95,1:17:31.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行规则」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.43,1:17:45.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.35,1:17:50.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想死 不能死…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.18,1:17:53.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为休比的错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.89,1:17:55.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而败北什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.49,1:18:06.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在的休比能做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.49,1:18:12.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了里克 能做的事…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:22.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}个体标识编号「Üc207Pr4f57t9」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.81,1:18:24.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向「Ü连结体第一指挥体」申请再连结
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.92,1:18:26.55,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(742.133,985.333)}{\pos(760.8,972)}生命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.92,1:18:26.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「心」的解析已经完成
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.55,1:18:28.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请批准再连结
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.51,1:18:34.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被永久解除连结处分的贵机的数据出现重大错误
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.35,1:18:35.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驳回申请
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.81,1:18:37.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拒绝驳回申请
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.52,1:18:42.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不论是如何报告的 也应该需要解析才对
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.77,1:18:44.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}申请再连结
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.69,1:18:46.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连结！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.07,1:18:50.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不… 订正
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.50,1:18:52.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你个不讲理的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.04,1:18:58.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本来不想交给任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.58,1:19:01.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢里克 不想跟里克分开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.38,1:19:03.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为很害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.13,1:19:06.30,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(1325.333,992)}{\pos(1296,984)}心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.13,1:19:06.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克给予我的 满溢而出的「错误」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.80,1:19:10.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部 全部都是只属于休比的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.43,1:19:12.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把那个交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我明白这份含义啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.24,1:19:20.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要再说废话了 把这份感情继承下去啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.79,1:19:40.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然贵机已经损坏
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.11,1:19:43.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.38,1:19:47.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}矛盾、破裂 但是仍在运作 异常
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.09,1:19:49.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.80,1:19:51.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能 不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.87,1:19:53.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是现实
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:56.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从里克那儿得到的心表明的事实
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.64,1:19:59.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.98,1:20:02.85,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1113.6,981.6)}贵重的样品数据
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.98,1:20:02.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}判断贵机为「特例担当」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.27,1:20:06.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数据同步开始
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.19,1:20:08.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离同步完成还有251秒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.03,1:20:12.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}期间禁止贵机的「全损」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.24,1:20:15.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「全典开」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:20.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「构筑」对未知用战斗演算启动
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:20:24.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这份思念 这颗心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.27,1:20:31.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从机械中孕育出来 得到了生命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.43,1:20:39.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这全部 都赌在这251秒里！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.37,1:20:46.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这巨大的翅膀 是在讽刺我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.76,1:20:50.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}区区人偶 正合我意
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.95,1:20:51.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.45,1:20:53.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啥？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.16,1:20:58.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没自报姓名 这就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.95,1:21:03.46,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(1320.533,984.8)}{\pos(1291.2,976.8)}我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.95,1:21:03.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从里克那儿得到的 重要的「名字」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.79,1:21:06.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.59,1:21:10.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是吉普莉尔 很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.29,1:21:11.40,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.22,1:21:14.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永别了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.61,1:21:24.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要跟着对方的步子走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.52,1:21:26.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不要交出主导权
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.81,1:21:28.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让对手大意吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.44,1:21:30.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让她以为我不足为惧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.03,1:21:32.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让对手警惕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.60,1:21:35.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让她产生不能攻击我的错觉
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.32,1:21:39.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在不行的话 就寄希望于下一步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.38,1:21:44.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.67,1:21:47.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不能死啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.50,1:22:07.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行规制」
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.46,1:22:28.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于犯下像样的「错误」了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.46,1:22:28.21,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1144.8,974.4)}打偏
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.46,1:22:30.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真让我费了一番功夫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.21,1:22:36.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打偏… 是指什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.36,1:22:41.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.77,1:22:44.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对刚才称呼你为废铁一事进行谢罪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.39,1:22:46.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撤回前言
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.48,1:22:51.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是需要被确实排除的威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.40,1:22:54.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我判断你为值得我拿出全力对付的敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.95,1:23:02.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同步完成
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.17,1:23:08.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.92,1:23:12.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是休比赢了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.25,1:23:15.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典开」—「进入禁止」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.61,1:23:31.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.82,1:23:34.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呐 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:38.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.44,1:23:46.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比能遇到里克 真的很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.36,1:23:52.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定不要再分开了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:56.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 爱着你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.97,1:24:08.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头颅没拿到手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.06,1:24:10.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}零件也全都打成渣了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.74,1:24:15.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且因为过度使用力量 变成了这副样子
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.73,1:24:21.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样子 到底有什么好处啦……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.42,1:24:39.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还以为这次绝对会赢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.34,1:24:43.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比两人一起 和大家一起的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.52,1:24:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然不知道哪方神圣制作了人类
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.94,1:24:53.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.73,1:24:55.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就一回而已
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.02,1:24:58.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅仅一回的胜利都不被允许吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.78,1:25:02.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.28,1:25:08.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样的话为什么要给予我们「心」啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.39,1:25:16.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 为什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.12,1:25:23.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克要在休比死之前活着
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.68,1:25:29.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 没错啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.44,1:25:36.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比死了的话 也好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.82,1:25:41.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样子…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.08,1:25:52.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「意志者」 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.08,1:25:52.00,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(897.6,974.4)}Spieler
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.84,1:26:00.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.21,1:26:02.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我没有名字
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.88,1:26:04.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过姑且叫我「全连结指挥体」吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.38,1:26:09.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为实现「遗志体」休比的遗志而来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.89,1:26:11.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.48,1:26:18.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}规则其二 不允许让任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.19,1:26:25.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克所定的规则 败北条件不包括道具的损失
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.58,1:26:30.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比的损失不包含其中
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.08,1:26:36.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军了 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.88,1:26:40.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.76,1:26:45.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面提供其附带情报
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:53.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一 目前「通行规则」设置点有多种族集结
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.81,1:26:56.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们有异常动作 连结体则会被感知
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.98,1:27:00.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投降概率有98%
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.48,1:27:04.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此能运作的「通行规则」已经全部设置完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.03,1:27:10.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共计仅24项 不足以诱导贯穿星球的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.41,1:27:16.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是向西南方的诱导可以实现
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.37,1:27:19.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二 我们机凯种
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.79,1:27:24.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以解析受到的攻击并展开模仿的武装
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.84,1:27:29.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}借此武装意志者里克可以贯穿星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.18,1:27:33.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此「星杯」也能得以显现
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:38.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们机凯种 无心的机械
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.10,1:27:40.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅为道具
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.98,1:27:44.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只会忠于命令并付诸实行
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.78,1:27:47.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 意志者里克
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.61,1:27:51.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将补正你的战略 请下令
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.58,1:27:55.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.37,1:28:04.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}命令 道具的损失 不视作败北
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.96,1:28:10.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 如果这就是你的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.22,1:28:13.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你如此希望的话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.22,1:28:21.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好可爱 有点讨厌修复术式了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.31,1:28:24.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明很久没能见到这么可爱的吉普酱
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.94,1:28:29.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}区区废铁 到底在打什么算盘
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.74,1:28:34.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上方感知到复数热源
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.66,1:28:36.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.37,1:28:42.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什什什 什么事…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.17,1:28:44.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚刚到底是谁在用天击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.92,1:28:47.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确认受到阿邦特·赫伊姆的先制攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.71,1:28:49.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备发射「髓爆」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.05,1:28:53.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虚空第零加护」全术式解放
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.93,1:28:55.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}右舷 目标阿尔特休
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.55,1:28:57.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左舷 地精种舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.56,1:29:00.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自阿邦特·赫伊姆的先制攻击？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.48,1:29:03.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不对… 这是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.11,1:29:11.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真敢小瞧我们呢 废铁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.50,1:29:29.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿尔特休大人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.26,1:29:33.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭候多时了 吾之天敌
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.80,1:29:39.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来如此 身为最弱却向我这个最强者挑战十分合理
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.20,1:29:44.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对吧 「猴子」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.02,1:29:46.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从阿邦特·赫伊姆的背后
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.15,1:29:49.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发射不杀死任何人的天击
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.74,1:29:51.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.42,1:29:55.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连结体开始向设置地点移动
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.59,1:29:58.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上全火力的冲突就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.48,1:30:02.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全员 准备
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.25,1:30:03.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对手是神灵种
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.04,1:30:08.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必能轻易看穿区区人类的小把戏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.45,1:30:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此那群家伙也要全力将其击溃
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.76,1:30:16.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是强者的概念 强者的道理
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.05,1:30:25.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认清自己的渺小吧 只会卖弄小聪明的尘芥
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.24,1:30:27.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}担雪塞井 以卵击石
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.19,1:30:34.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渺小虫介即便群聚而上也无法触碰天威
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.36,1:30:37.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虚空第零加护」全术式齐展开
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.25,1:30:40.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「髓爆」全弹发射
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.20,1:30:42.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「神击」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.76,1:30:56.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便有虚空第零加护和髓爆的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.38,1:31:00.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也无法阻止阿尔特休的神击
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.68,1:31:04.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的能量相互碰撞 收束
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.60,1:31:08.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为宣告这世界毁灭的光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.61,1:31:14.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.87,1:31:28.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏向了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.86,1:31:35.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把这能量
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.18,1:31:40.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是机械 没有内心的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.01,1:31:44.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无命而往 持命而逝
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.19,1:31:46.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「以上」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.54,1:31:48.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「明白」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.85,1:31:59.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投入4807连结体 成功再现设计 开始同步
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.32,1:32:09.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}典开 org.0000「真典·弑星者」 托付给你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:28.27,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1092,981.6)}Stalement
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:28.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样子 就是平局了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.44,1:32:32.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉啊 众神
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.40,1:33:10.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星杯…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.11,1:33:18.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了这一瞬间 有多少人死去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.31,1:33:21.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.48,1:33:23.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}活生生的他们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.36,1:33:28.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底死了多少人！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.51,1:33:31.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至不惜欺骗自己
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.71,1:33:35.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至把休比的思念踩在脚下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:43.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这 这到底算哪门子平局啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.76,1:33:51.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.98,1:33:55.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.40,1:33:57.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又输了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.40,1:34:04.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说休比 如果我们再度合而为一的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.18,1:34:08.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次一定要赢啊 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.00,1:34:12.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会再让任何人死了 这种游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.04,1:34:16.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果神是从思念之中诞生的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.25,1:34:21.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏之神
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.02,1:34:24.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然是如垃圾一般不值一提的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.38,1:34:27.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是奉献我所有的 人生中第一次的乞求
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.91,1:34:29.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.52,1:34:34.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果说区区败者 也想窃取胜利果实太肮脏的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.48,1:34:37.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果说这双手早已沾满鲜血的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.06,1:34:43.44,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1000.8,969.6)}心
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.06,1:34:43.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了 至少告诉我 「我们」的意义在哪里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.78,1:34:47.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁都可以 让这场战争结束吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.73,1:34:51.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将这星杯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.64,1:34:53.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁来…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.59,1:35:06.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈 什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.18,1:35:09.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然还是有的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.51,1:35:13.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呐 下次再来玩游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.28,1:35:16.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次一定会赢过你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.35,1:35:20.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比两人一起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.35,1:35:22.40,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对可以
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.92,1:35:39.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小时候 我认为世界应该是更为单纯的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.49,1:35:42.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有赢不了的比试
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.64,1:35:44.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回报
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.03,1:35:46.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆为可能
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.30,1:35:51.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用天真无邪的眼光去看世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.99,1:35:53.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.05,1:36:10.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将死了呢 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.33,1:36:16.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果一切顺利的话
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.00,1:36:20.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能帮我把白车移动到E6呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.71,1:36:21.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.41,1:36:24.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.77,1:36:26.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.30,1:36:28.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.34,1:36:32.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今为止 十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.88,1:36:36.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说里克 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.68,1:36:40.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个真的做了很厉害的事哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.94,1:36:43.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完结了永远的战争哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.48,1:36:45.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.36,1:36:51.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太奇怪了吧 为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.25,1:36:57.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐我为什么会这么不甘心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.83,1:37:04.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏还没结束哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.29,1:37:07.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是「将死」而是「将军」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.97,1:37:11.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:14.89,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(962.4,974.4)}Perpetual Check
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:14.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陷入「长将」了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.39,1:37:20.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我打成平手还是第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.65,1:37:28.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非由谁创造
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.78,1:37:30.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非有谁希冀
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.03,1:37:32.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非有谁祈愿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.70,1:37:35.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅凭自身意志
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.66,1:37:37.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从野兽进化成双足行走
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.54,1:37:41.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并掌握智慧的无名种族
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.54,1:37:42.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.50,1:37:46.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要作为唯一神赐予你们名字
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.67,1:37:49.80,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(969.6,964.8)}immunity
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.67,1:37:49.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「人类种」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.92,1:37:51.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.35,1:37:57.39,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(968.001,1035.667)}十条盟约
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.39,1:37:57.43,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(978.667,646.334)}十条盟约
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.39,1:37:57.43,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\pos(978.666,803.667)}【一】这个世界禁止一切杀伤、战争与掠夺。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.39,1:37:57.43,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\pos(965.333,958.333)}【二】所有的纠纷一律以游戏胜负解决。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.39,1:37:57.43,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\pos(962,1097)}【三】游戏需赌上双方判断对等的赌注。
