Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.31,1:38:07.15,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\move(980,680,980,640)}【十】大家一起和平地玩游戏吧！！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.15,1:38:08.77,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\move(980,35,980,25)\fad(0,500)}【七】集团间的纠纷应指定全权代理人。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.15,1:38:08.77,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\move(980,185,980,175)\fad(0,500)}【八】游戏中若有不正当行为，一旦败露即视同败北。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.15,1:38:08.77,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\move(980,345,980,335)\fad(0,500)}【九】以神之名宣布，以上各条皆为绝对不变的规则。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.15,1:38:08.77,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\move(980,640,980,630)}【十】大家一起和平地玩游戏吧！！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.77,1:38:12.53,ngnlzero - text1,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fs45\pos(980,630)\fad(0,500)}【十】大家一起和平地玩游戏吧！！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.51,1:37:56.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自称拥有知性的「十六种族」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1015.2,984)}アシエイト
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继承「意志者们的公仪」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.64,1:38:03.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}视为「十六种族的同意」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.64,1:38:03.14,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1015.2,991.2)}アッシエント
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以「唯一神之座」而定的「十条盟约」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(712,992)}{\pos(732,993.6)}アシエンテ
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.07,1:38:10.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从今天开始 世界改变了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.57,1:38:14.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 继续游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.30,1:38:31.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个故事 哪里是说谎哪里是真实
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.58,1:38:34.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是 把真相全部告诉你的话
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.53,1:38:36.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就不是「不能诉说的神话」了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.73,1:38:39.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然你很惹人讨厌的说
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.03,1:38:44.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过抚摸很舒服就原谅你的说
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.27,1:38:46.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊纲
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.93,1:38:48.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊纲碳
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.64,1:38:52.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空 白 史蒂公
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.58,1:38:56.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 你跑哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.12,1:38:58.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有很多可疑的人哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.99,1:39:02.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像哥哥和白那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.06,1:39:04.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赢了就跑什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.08,1:39:07.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊纲 这可不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.44,1:39:10.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有这种怪人存在哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.55,1:39:15.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.80,1:39:19.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这文字是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.83,1:39:21.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普莉尔
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.63,1:39:23.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在在在
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.14,1:39:25.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能看懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.39,1:39:29.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是人类种语言统一前的语言呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.35,1:39:33.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细想想 不正是这家伙的错吗 的说
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.07,1:39:36.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\blur3}里克·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.43,1:39:38.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.53,1:39:39.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:42.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是艾尔奇亚的建国女王
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.63,1:39:45.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一生中都没人见过她哭泣
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.30,1:39:47.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满着知性和笑容的才女
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.96,1:39:49.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是多拉家族的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.78,1:39:51.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有两位呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.88,1:39:54.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道… 不认识呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.85,1:39:59.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比… 那好像不是人类种来着
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.96,1:40:06.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊纲觉得自己认识他们的说
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.39,1:40:09.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.84,1:40:15.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界什么的 其实是十分单纯的事物
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.32,1:40:18.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如他感受到的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.72,1:40:22.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难得我制造出来的单纯的游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.49,1:40:25.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它弄的这么复杂的那群人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.71,1:40:27.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们一定能将其打倒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.21,1:40:29.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.74,1:40:44.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.35,1:40:49.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始游戏吧
